  <main class="seo-section">
    <h1>Rooms &amp; Exits Chapter 3 Level 18 Walkthrough: Basement</h1>

    <p>The Basement is the eighteenth room of Chapter 3, <i>Murder Dressed in White</i>, and it is the busiest utility space in the chapter. A concrete box with a blue-riser staircase, a numbered locker bank, a washer and dryer on a pallet, a wall sink, a water heater, a pipe manifold, a weight bench and a red barrel you would not want to stand next to. It also has more locks than any room around it: a coat-rack combination, a round-button keypad, a pipe valve list and two numeric keypads.</p>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with Webelinx Games, the developer of Rooms &amp; Exits: Escape Room Games.</div>

    <div class="verify-note">Rebuilt at one frame per second. The valve list <b>3L / 1S / 2V / 5W</b> was read twice — once from a 2x crop and once from a four-frame zoom set — and both agreed. The keypad code <b>1200</b> was read twice from the green display. The weight-bench label <b>18kilo-18kilo</b> was read twice at different crops. The five-digit string on the last keypad did not survive two reads, so it is listed under "What this page could not verify" rather than printed as a code.</div>

    <LevelSelector chapter={3} current={18} variant="jump" label="Chapter 3 · Murder Dressed in White" />

    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>Basement is room 18 of Chapter 3. The pipe manifold is set from <b>3L, 1S, 2V, 5W</b>; the wall keypad takes <b>1200</b>; the barbell wants <b>18</b> kilos on each side.</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Clear the left wall first: the blue cabinet (0:42), its drawers (1:06) and the <b>Cloth</b> pickup at 0:25.</li>
        <li>Read the coat rack at <b>1:24</b> — white bins above, three blue hangers below — then work the round-button keypad at 1:30.</li>
        <li>Do the laundry chain: <b>Rings</b> at 2:06 and 2:12, <b>Laundry</b> at 2:24, washer at 2:36, ring tower at 3:06.</li>
        <li>Work the pipe room: the valve list at <b>4:54</b>, five W wheels at 5:00, the letter dial at 5:06.</li>
        <li>Enter <b>1200</b> on the wall keypad at 5:30.</li>
        <li>Load the barbell to <b>18 kilo</b> a side (6:30), take the horoscope from the bench compartment (7:06), and match it to the zodiac suitcase (7:36).</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

